WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.536
Oh no!

2
00:00:02.069 --> 00:00:06.857
Three stacks of cards, and Maya cannot tell which is biggest just by looking!

3
00:00:07.389 --> 00:00:10.655
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:11.188 --> 00:00:13.582
This is Episode 85.

5
00:00:14.114 --> 00:00:16.107
Meet the picture easel.

6
00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:18.609
It paints the answer.

7
00:00:19.141 --> 00:00:22.443
Three bars: tall, medium, short.

8
00:00:22.976 --> 00:00:25.122
Now you see it in one look.

9
00:00:25.654 --> 00:00:29.216
A circle cut into slices: which part is biggest?

10
00:00:29.749 --> 00:00:32.602
A wavy line going up: are we growing?

11
00:00:33.134 --> 00:00:34.514
Yes!

12
00:00:35.047 --> 00:00:38.443
Add a new card, and the picture grows by itself.

13
00:00:38.975 --> 00:00:41.428
No counting, no squinting.

14
00:00:41.961 --> 00:00:43.447
Just look.

15
00:00:43.979 --> 00:00:46.314
That is Amazon QuickSight.

16
00:00:46.847 --> 00:00:50.821
It turns your data into simple pictures you understand in a second.

17
00:00:51.353 --> 00:00:53.582
Now you know the picture easel!

18
00:00:54.115 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

